#
# Fresh names, checked against the shipped cast and the whole pin suite before
# use: Torvi, Marn, Vasha, Quilo, Sepp. The cast-collision hazard is real — an
# earlier delivery fixture reused an existing deceit victim's name and passed,
# which is the dangerous way for it to fail.
person(Torvi).
person(Marn).
person(Vasha).
person(Quilo).
person(Sepp).

# Torvi exposes something about a public office holder. That is the whistle,
# and chapter 4's shield is what it earns.
show(Torvi, Boss).

# Marn does every act the paid examiner door asks for, about Vasha.
judge(Marn, Vasha).
capture(Marn, Vasha).
cite(Marn, MarnGround, Vasha).
